  "body": "According to [fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#navigation-request), a navigation request can have destination  \"document\", \"embed\", \"frame\", \"iframe\", or \"object\". It [seems](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-destination:~:text=HTML%E2%80%99s%20navigate%20algorithm%20(top%2Dlevel%20only)) like navigation requests should only use \"document\" for top-level navigations. However, html always set the destination of navigation requests to \"document\".\r\n\r\nIt's not clear to me whether this should be changed in html or in fetch.",
